Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.10,0:00:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 000 请问有什么紧急状况 - 999 请问有什么紧急状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Triple-zero, what is your emergency? - 9-9-9, what's your emergency?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.10,0:00:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,911 请问有什么紧急状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}9-1-1, what is your emergency?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.56,0:00:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人知道真相到底是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one knows what's true anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.65,0:00:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是世界末日 但看得出…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not the end of the world, but you can see…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.65,0:00:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,供电系统全面瘫痪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Power grid has collapsed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.07,0:00:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,货币变成壁纸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Currency is worthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.57,0:00:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,城市付之一炬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cities are burning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.57,0:00:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,瘟疫和流行病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pestilence and pandemics.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.11,0:00:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,灾难性的高温\N{\fnArial\fs30}Catastrophic heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.36,0:00:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们逐渐耗尽水资源\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're actually running out of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.99,0:00:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何要伤害这些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you hurting these people?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.62,0:00:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界局势濒临崩盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting close to the terminal freak-out point.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.91,0:00:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类秩序瓦解 开始弱肉强食\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mankind has gone rogue, terrorizing itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.42,0:00:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord0\fs18\b1}芙莉欧莎：疯狂麦斯传奇篇章
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.97,0:00:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮派烧杀掳掠 如蝗虫横扫大地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gangs are marauding like locusts across the land.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.30,0:00:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,全球土壤酸化\N{\fnArial\fs30}The earth is sour.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.89,0:01:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 人类疾病丛生 - 我们经历了半衰期\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Our bones are poisoned. - We have become half-life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.02,0:01:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,随着世界的瓦解\N{\fnArial\fs30}As the world falls around us,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.53,0:01:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该如何坚强面对残酷的世道\N{\fnArial\fs30}how must we brave its cruelties?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.88,0:01:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,1.难抵极
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.57,0:01:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这颗是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one's for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.74,0:01:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再摘下那颗给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get that one for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.32,0:02:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,该回去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should go back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.45,0:02:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们跑出来太远了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've come too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.16,0:02:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,芙莉欧莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Furiosa!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.21,0:02:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 贪心鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Vulture.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.42,0:02:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,小声点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not so loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.05,0:02:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,有见过这么多肉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you ever seen so much meat?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.51,0:02:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay very still.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.47,0:02:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.22,0:02:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦尔基丽 隐身起来 在我回来前都不要乱动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Valkyrie, be invisible. Still as a rock till I get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.90,0:02:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让人看见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be invisible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.06,0:03:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 小心头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful. Careful with the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.18,0:03:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,脊椎是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That spine's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.89,0:03:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,从那里切下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.46,0:03:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.09,0:04:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车 上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get on! Get on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.68,0:04:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,芙莉欧莎 他们掳走了芙莉欧莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Furiosa! They took Furiosa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.74,0:05:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll come with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.99,0:05:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 这里的人更需要你守护\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, they need you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.70,0:05:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道此处的人都不能留活口
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.91,0:05:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个也不留
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.80,0:05:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿星辰与你同在\N{\fnArial\fs30}The stars be with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.72,0:06:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,狙击手 有狙击手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snipers! We got snipers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.14,0:07:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个追兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lone rider.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.63,0:08:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她破坏了机车\N{\fnArial\fs30}She fouled us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.10,0:08:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,被她咬穿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She bit through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.81,0:08:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 你在干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.93,0:08:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我 给我 给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, give it. Give it. Give it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.53,0:08:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是雷霆机车\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the Thunderbike.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.74,0:08:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是雷霆机车\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the Thunderbike!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.79,0:09:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我以为你把车弄烂了 - 我有啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I thought you crippled it. - I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.30,0:09:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁在追我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's coming for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.88,0:09:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个人是谁 你老子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is… who is that? Is that your pa?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.14,0:09:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你爸吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that your father? Who…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.06,0:09:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂喂喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Hey, hey, hey. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.52,0:09:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,把女孩丢包吧 他只想要她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ditch the girl! That's all he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.98,0:09:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们要怎么跟狄门特斯交代\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we tell Dementus?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.69,0:09:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有马肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got horse meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.82,0:09:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这证明不了什么 但有了这女孩 一旦他看到 就会问\N{\fnArial\fs30}It proves nothing. But the girl, once he sees her, he's gonna ask,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.91,0:09:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,「她从哪里来 」 我们就能提供他答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Where did she come from?" And we're gonna be the ones to tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.20,0:09:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,再也不会有人看扁我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's gonna scum us anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.33,0:09:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,再也不会有人看扁我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's gonna scum us anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.71,0:09:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再也不会有人看扁我们 - 再也不会有人看扁我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's gonna scum us anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.88,0:09:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个小贱货\N{\fnArial\fs30}That piece of filth!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.51,0:11:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会成功 我们一定会成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna make it. We're gonna make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.41,0:11:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有大消息要给狄门特斯 狄门特斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got news for Dementus. Dementus!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.54,0:11:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,脚垢 你带回来什么 独自一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you got here, Toe Jam? All by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.67,0:11:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只对狄门特斯说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I speak only to Dementus.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.96,0:12:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 把手拿开\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Hands off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.22,0:12:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,解开她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Untie it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.09,0:12:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我找到的 她是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found it. She's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.35,0:12:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hands off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.06,0:12:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好强壮 真是个小辣椒\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's strong. What a dilly, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.10,0:12:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她是我的 - 你在哪找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's mine. Where did you find it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.31,0:12:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还给我 - 在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Give it back. - Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.40,0:12:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在哪找到的 - 还给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where did you get it? - Give her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.36,0:12:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她给我 我带她去见他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give her to me. I'll take her to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.52,0:12:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,她来自丰饶之地\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's from a place of abundance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.61,0:12:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在讲什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.82,0:12:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,丰饶之地 那里什么都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}A place of abundance! It's got everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.95,0:12:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.24,0:12:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只跟狄门特斯谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I speak only to Dementus.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.79,0:12:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来自哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you from?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.17,0:12:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来自哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you from?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.17,0:12:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪找到她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you find her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.01,0:12:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的嘴 狄门特斯的耳朵 我只跟狄门特斯说\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lips, Dementus's ear. My lips. Dementus.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.42,0:13:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.88,0:13:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,原装版JRL牌七福重机\N{\fnArial\fs30}The original JRL Cycles Lucky Seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.01,0:13:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,由七缸星形航空引擎驱动\N{\fnArial\fs30}was powered by a seven cylinder radial aircraft engine,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.85,0:13:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,排气量为2800CC\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a swept capacity of 2, 800cc's,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.81,0:13:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,110匹马力 160磅扭力\N{\fnArial\fs30}110 horsepower, 160 pounds of torque.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.77,0:13:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,狄门特斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dementus.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.28,0:13:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,狄门特斯 你看我找到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dementus. Look what I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.83,0:13:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位是谁啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who do we have here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.09,0:14:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.01,0:14:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都怎么称呼你\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do they call you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.51,0:14:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,她来自丰饶之地\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's from a place of abundance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.68,0:14:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可以看看吗 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- May I? - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.28,0:14:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个健康 营养良好的全寿人 完美无缺\N{\fnArial\fs30}A healthy, well-nourished full-life. Flawless.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.79,0:14:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我们你来自哪里 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell us where you're from, child. Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.46,0:14:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.05,0:14:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里什么都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.72,0:14:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.97,0:14:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,小比利帮的人告诉我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Roobilly told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.60,0:14:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说是他亲眼所见\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he saw it with his own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.73,0:15:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.32,0:15:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们让脚垢自己来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's hear from Toe Jam.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.49,0:15:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他带进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.66,0:15:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找到她的那个地方 那里很棒 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place, where you found her, it was amazing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.91,0:15:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里什么都有 对吧 有水 有食物 什么都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}It had everything, right? Water, food, everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.92,0:15:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.30,0:15:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在呛血\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's choking.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.76,0:15:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他倒过来好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, hang him upside down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.35,0:15:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒转一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Downside up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.85,0:15:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.90,0:15:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,画个地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}Draw a map.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.23,0:15:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,画个箭头 画个箭头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Draw an arrow. Draw an arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.78,0:15:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我们指路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show us! Show us!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.88,0:16:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也累了一天了 对吧 今天过得很糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you have had a hard day, haven't you? An awful day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.85,0:16:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定累坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.14,0:16:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只需要你做一件事 那就是好好休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only one thing I need you to do and that is rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.44,0:16:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么都不需要告诉我们 一个字都不用说 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to tell us anything. You don't have to say a word, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.98,0:16:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,休息就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.44,0:16:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天 我就送你回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow, I'll take you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.82,0:16:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会跟随你来到这里的踪迹 然后送你回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll follow the tracks that brought you here and I'll take you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.78,0:16:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,带她下去 去吃饭和洗澡 用最好的饮用水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take her, feed her, wash her. Use our best drinking water.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.87,0:16:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.33,0:16:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,看好她 保护她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep an eye on her, keep her safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.84,0:16:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让那些杂碎接近她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let any of these brutes near her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.02,0:17:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 你抢了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what you got there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.18,0:18:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,史奈普 史奈普\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snapper. Snapper!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.44,0:18:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.73,0:18:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,饶命 我也有孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. I'm a mother, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.74,0:18:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都不会说 一个字都不说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will say nothing, not a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.82,0:19:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,拦下她 拦下她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Stop her!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.20,0:19:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 开枪 开枪 - 快开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shoot! Shoot! Shoot! - Shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.67,0:19:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.02,0:19:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 可以走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, we're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.60,0:20:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在流血\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.22,0:20:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有听到吗 走 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you hear that? Come, quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.15,0:20:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是怎么追踪我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are they tracking us?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.14,0:21:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,骑到高地 好好躲起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ride to high ground. Hide yourself well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.35,0:21:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,若我一日未归 就自己回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I don't find you in one day, go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.19,0:21:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.94,0:21:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,用日月星辰导航\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take your bearings from the sun and stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.11,0:21:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,起风时 用风沙掩盖踪迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}When there is wind, use it to cover your tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.69,0:21:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不愿丢下你 - 芙莉欧莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not gonna leave you. - Furiosa!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.19,0:21:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是芙佛里尼族人 你要服从命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are Vuvalini, you'll do as I ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.16,0:21:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管要付出什么代价 也无论要花多长时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you have to do, however long it takes,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.95,0:21:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,答应我你会找到回家的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}promise me you'll find your way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.96,0:21:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,种下这颗种子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plant this seed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.42,0:21:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护众母绿地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Protect the Green Place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.30,0:21:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,满足我的心愿 许下承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me this one gift. Promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.78,0:22:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿星辰与你同在\N{\fnArial\fs30}The stars be with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.02,0:22:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,绕过去 大家绕过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go around! Gotta go around!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.19,0:22:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,找别条路绕过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find a way around!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.74,0:23:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.78,0:23:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.08,0:23:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 告诉我 - 她是你妈 好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tell me! - She's your mother. Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.45,0:23:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来自哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you from?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.33,0:23:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.33,0:23:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.04,0:23:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我们你们来自哪里 我们就放过她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me where you came from and we will cease and desist.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.92,0:23:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,芙莉欧莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Furiosa!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.22,0:23:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只需要用手指出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you have to do… All you have to do is just point.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.51,0:23:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我指出正确方向 我就会带你回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Point me in the right direction and I'll take you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.98,0:24:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 别逃避\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. Don't look away.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.98,0:24:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能逃避现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}We mustn't look away.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.56,0:24:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有过机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had your chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.78,0:24:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,史学家 给我们来堂单字课\N{\fnArial\fs30}History Man, a Word Burger, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.20,0:24:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼泪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.20,0:24:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类的眼泪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.95,0:24:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,泪腺的分泌物含有油脂\N{\fnArial\fs30}The secretions of the lacrimal gland containing oils,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.58,0:24:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,盐分 蛋白质 和压力荷尔蒙\N{\fnArial\fs30}salts, proteins, and stress hormones.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.95,0:24:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,喜悦和悲伤的泪水 具有不同化学成分\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tears of joy and those of sorrow have different chemical compositions.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.92,0:24:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 所以悲伤的泪水更为…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Sorrow is more…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.09,0:24:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛辣 刺激\N{\fnArial\fs30}…piquant, zesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.07,0:24:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,2.来自荒地的课程
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.84,0:25:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何要逃给我追\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you run from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.97,0:25:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你手下必须争夺 由谁手刃你的殊荣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now your followers must fight over who gets to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.10,0:25:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来会很欢迎 你们每个人的加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I would've welcomed you. Every one. I woulda brought you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.36,0:25:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们本可以成为 这个大家庭的一分子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You coulda been a part of this great horde.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.53,0:25:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们面临难题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, we have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.57,0:25:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有二十个人 却只有五辆机车\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are 20 of you, but only five bikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.99,0:25:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,该怎么选\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we choose?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.28,0:25:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁有足够本领 勇气和胆量 来加入狄门特斯的车队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's got the goods, the bollocks, the testes to ride with Dementus?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.08,0:25:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们得拿出看家本领才行\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna have to show me who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.84,0:25:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.84,0:25:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为今天 我们要仰赖物竞天择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because today we dance to Darwin.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.05,0:25:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天 我们要进行「五车拉拉乐」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today, we do The Five Bike Teddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.39,0:26:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,各就各位 预备 开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready, setty, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.58,0:26:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你不想看就别看\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to watch if you don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.63,0:26:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你会想闭上眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may wanna close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.30,0:26:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,若是你想 这个也可以给你抱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you could hold this if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.18,0:26:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我孩子的玩偶\N{\fnArial\fs30}It belonged to my little ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.23,0:26:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,交给你照顾 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you just keep him safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.53,0:27:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士和先生们 请启动引擎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady and gentlemans, start your engines.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.77,0:27:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜥蜴绞肉和人血香肠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lizard mince and human blood sausage.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.32,0:28:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会写字吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you write?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.57,0:28:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以教你 增强你的记忆 你也可以成为史学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can teach you. Muscle up your memory. You could become a History Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.12,0:28:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,提升你的价值 这样狄门特斯就会照顾你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make yourself invaluable, and Dementus will look after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.26,0:29:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,天文导航\N{\fnArial\fs30}Astronavigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.55,0:29:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,透过参考恒星和其他天体的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}A determination of one's course by reference to the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.39,0:29:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,来决定一个人的路线\N{\fnArial\fs30}and other celestial bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.19,0:29:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,红色信号弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red! Red!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.24,0:29:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,要去看看吗 老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we curious, boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.53,0:29:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就去一探究竟吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's go have a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.01,0:30:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是英灵殿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this Halvalla?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.05,0:30:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来到英灵殿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I in Valhalla?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.06,0:30:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,英灵殿是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's Valhalla?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.31,0:30:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,英灵殿 死者的殿堂 往生英雄的天堂应许地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Valhalla's "The Hall of the Slain." A paradise for dead heroes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.56,0:30:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不就好棒棒 我们在找丰饶之地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good for you. We're looking for a place of abundance.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.86,0:30:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,丰饶是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's abundance?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.44,0:30:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,丰富 繁多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abundance, plentifulness.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.95,0:30:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,意思就是取之不尽 用之不竭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Having a copious quantity of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.78,0:30:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,用之不竭是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Co… What's "copus quantity"?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.24,0:30:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,意思就是很多 很多好东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lotta stuff. A lotta good stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.16,0:30:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,堡垒\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Citadel.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.29,0:30:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么垒\N{\fnArial\fs30}The what-a-del?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.83,0:30:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是我出生的地方 那里什么都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's where I was birthed. It's got everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.46,0:30:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,超级多干净活水\N{\fnArial\fs30}A humongous amount of fresh water.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.17,0:30:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有绿色的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}And green stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.01,0:30:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,成堆的作物 蔬菜 还有水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mountains of pro-juice and veggies and… and water.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.93,0:30:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,要去哪里找这个堡垒\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where would one find this Citadel?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.89,0:30:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许是那头\N{\fnArial\fs30}That way maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.60,0:30:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这又是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are these?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.23,0:30:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是天血弹 我用这个招唤了你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is sky blood. It called you to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.13,0:32:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来见证狄门特斯无上的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behold the might of Dementus!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.84,0:32:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,火焰加身的狄门特斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Red Dementus.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.43,0:32:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及他的毁灭者大军\N{\fnArial\fs30}and his Congress of Destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.89,0:33:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他前来征服各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is here to lay siege on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.19,0:33:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,请倾听他的宣言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen carefully to his words.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.19,0:33:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.78,0:33:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有保护并扶持 这座宏伟堡垒的人民\N{\fnArial\fs30}All who protect and honor this magnificent Citadel,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.04,0:33:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有一个选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.12,0:33:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常诱人的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}A very attractive choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.33,0:33:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要你们的领导者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want your leaders.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.55,0:33:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要那些主宰你们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want those who hold dominance over you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.01,0:33:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,带你们的领导者出列 将他们丢下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring me your leaders and throw them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.05,0:33:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,将他们丢下来 就能避免更多的折磨与忧愁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throw them down, and you'll avoid more suffering and sorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.77,0:33:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们剥削你们 他们奴役你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They exploit you. They enslave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.44,0:33:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们吸食践踏你们的血汗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They wash their feet in your sweat and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.36,0:33:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,更对你们毫无回馈\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they give you nothing in return.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.82,0:33:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,倾听我们的箴言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to this truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.16,0:33:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,大人物能领头 只因你们选择跟随\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big shots rule only because you choose to follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.70,0:34:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,权力掌握在你们手中\N{\fnArial\fs30}The power is with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.75,0:34:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可以自由选择 到我这边来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are free to choose. Come to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.08,0:34:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,带着你们的痛苦和负担投奔我 我会让每日口粮翻倍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come to me with your pain and burden, and I will double your grub.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.88,0:34:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,无限量地给所有人提供食物和水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Food and water for everyone, as much you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.17,0:34:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会分享所有财富\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will share the wealth.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.13,0:34:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家会跟我一起统治灿烂的新荒地\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will rule with me in the splendor of a new Wasteland.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.11,0:34:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,造型真可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.16,0:34:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好为你担心 小甜心 真的很担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid for you, sweetheart. Really afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.70,0:34:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为大吉利会用双手把你扯下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause Big Jilly here is gonna scoop you out, both ends,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.67,0:34:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,搓碎你的身体 再喂给你吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}mush it up and feed it back to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.79,0:34:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那完全无法跟诺顿先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that ain't nothing compared to what Mr. Norton here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.67,0:34:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要对你做的事相比\N{\fnArial\fs30}is dreaming of doing to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.42,0:34:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为诺顿先生最恨大人物了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause Mr. Norton really hates big shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.22,0:34:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 然后还有哈雷先生 - 日安 朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Then there's Mr. Harley. - G'day, mate!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.43,0:35:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴维森先生 雷斯戴佩尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Davidson, Rizzdale Pell.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.31,0:35:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有其他上千名 紧咬你们不放的疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a thousand other mad bastards coming after you,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.98,0:35:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完全无法阻止他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there ain't nothing I can do to stop 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.45,0:35:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不死王有个要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Immortan has a request.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.95,0:35:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,从他在此集结的所有战士中 选出一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Among all his warriors assembled here, choose one.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.75,0:35:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我干嘛要选\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would I do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.29,0:35:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,要想继续进行交涉 你必须随机选出一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}For this negotiation to go further, you must choose at random.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.67,0:35:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,任一位战争男孩 只选一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any War Boy. Just one.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.63,0:35:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,若我选择不选呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if I choose not to choose?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.76,0:35:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就永远不会知道真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you'll never know the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.02,0:35:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,由我的弄臣来选\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Smeg will choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.68,0:35:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.36,0:35:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.58,0:36:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 右边那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope. To the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.87,0:36:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,荣耀等待着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are awaited.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.66,0:36:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,见证我的壮烈成仁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Witness me!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.12,0:36:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,见证吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Witness!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.51,0:37:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有972位死忠的战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Among us are 972 devout warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.72,0:37:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何一位被选上时 都愿意做出同样牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any one of them, if chosen, would've done the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.19,0:37:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何一位都会为不死老乔 名留青史地死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each would die historic for the Immortan Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.94,0:37:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以你们才是傻子 - 你才是傻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's why you're fools. - You're the fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.74,0:37:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有傻子才会来此挑衅\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're all fools for coming here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.58,0:37:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是史阔塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Scrotus.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.88,0:37:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我是瑞塔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Rictus.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.75,0:37:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是不死老乔之子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are the sons of the Immortan Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.80,0:37:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们会杀了你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now we're going to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.30,0:38:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.25,0:38:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抓住你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.90,0:39:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,当情势不妙时 就得随机应变\N{\fnArial\fs30}When things go bonkers, you have to adapt.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.65,0:39:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我都一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, same as me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.12,0:39:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.33,0:39:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很坚强\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.62,0:39:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这只鲜美的小奶狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're a tender little hound.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.16,0:39:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,满载的武装运输车\N{\fnArial\fs30}A War Rig. Fully loaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.71,0:39:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,车队的确来自堡垒 车上还有不死王的印记\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's from the Citadel, all right. It's got the Immortan's mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.80,0:39:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,炼油城 荒地第二要塞
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.93,0:39:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,用食物和饮用水换取汽油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Food and water for guzzolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.81,0:39:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,总比拾荒好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It beats scavenging.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.27,0:40:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的天命\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.44,0:40:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们身处机运满满的宝地\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are indeed in the land of opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.18,0:41:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,看好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.70,0:41:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,向狄门特斯致敬\N{\fnArial\fs30}All hail Dementus!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.53,0:41:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,狄门特斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dementus!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.37,0:41:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,狄门特斯
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.83,0:41:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,足够所有人使用 几个月分的汽油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuel for all, enough for months.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.83,0:41:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天真是美好的一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thisis truly a great day.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.33,0:41:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 但我即将让一切变得更棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, I'm about to make it a whole lot greater.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.96,0:41:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是哪位 把安全帽和外套脱掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you? Remove your helmet and jacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.88,0:41:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只听命于八爪老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take orders from The Octoboss.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.13,0:41:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.76,0:41:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 照他说的做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, do what he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.27,0:42:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,胆敢质疑我的老大权威\N{\fnArial\fs30}Questioning my boss-ority.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.15,0:42:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 这样就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, that's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.74,0:42:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,用这个涂满全身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cover yourself in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.25,0:42:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.63,0:42:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.55,0:42:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.80,0:42:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}There ya go.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.93,0:42:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,选十个手下 毛发越少越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Choose ten of your men. The balder the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.18,0:42:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,死神帮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mortifiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.35,0:42:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,别乱动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Settle down.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.56,0:42:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,有谁想要当战争男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who wants to be a War Boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.77,0:43:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.56,0:43:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,武装运输车回来了 好像遭受攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rig's coming back. I think they're under attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.96,0:43:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要打开大门吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we open the gates?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.05,0:43:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,先不要 情况不太对\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Something's off.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.43,0:44:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得减速\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna have to slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.80,0:44:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 加速 要加速\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Faster. Go faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.22,0:44:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不会打开大门\N{\fnArial\fs30}They won't open the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.56,0:44:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们没有中计\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not buying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.15,0:44:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,射杀他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot them.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.28,0:44:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.40,0:44:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来玩真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make it real.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.61,0:44:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.57,0:44:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想要假戏真做\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants us to make it real.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.37,0:44:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.04,0:44:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.75,0:44:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个杂碎 狄门特斯 杂碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're scum, Dementus. Scum!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.01,0:44:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开大门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.59,0:44:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开大门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the gates!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.73,0:45:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开大门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.01,0:46:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,退下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back off.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.68,0:46:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.06,0:46:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这个交给不死老乔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give this to Immortan Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.06,0:46:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,接好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.65,0:46:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,狄门特斯想要协商\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dementus wants to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.57,0:46:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.20,0:46:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 让他进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Let him come.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.37,0:46:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,先搜身 不准携带武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Body search, no weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.96,0:46:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管他想要什么 我们先听听看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever he wants, we'll listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.67,0:46:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后再就地诛杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then kill him on the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.69,0:46:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,别激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.81,0:46:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,别激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.95,0:47:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,火焰狄门特斯 赞扬你的生活方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Red Dementus commends you on your lifestyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.53,0:47:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,也赞扬你同意与我们协商\N{\fnArial\fs30}and for agreeing to these trade negotiations.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.37,0:47:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,若日落前我们没有安全回去 我们就炸毁炼油城\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we're not back safe by sunset, we blow up Gastown.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.88,0:47:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要挽救炼油城只有这个方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is how you save Gastown.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.27,0:47:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,解除炸弹的六位数密码 只存在于狄门特斯的脑海内\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the six-figure code exists only in the brain of Dementus.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.28,0:47:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想要双倍的一切物资\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants double. Double of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.87,0:47:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,用一个油罐车的清水 来换半个油罐车的汽油\N{\fnArial\fs30}One full tank of water for half a tank of guzzolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.45,0:47:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们做不到 那是不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't do that. Not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.29,0:47:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他就只能钢钉穿脑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then he gets a spike in the nut.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.54,0:48:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,双倍的母乳 和双倍的水耕作物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Double the mothers' milk and double the hydroponics.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.04,0:48:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,双倍的马铃薯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Double the spuds.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.80,0:48:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,双倍的蛆泥和蟑螂粥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Double the maggot mash and the roach gruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.96,0:48:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的手下需要多多摄取蛋白质\N{\fnArial\fs30}My boys need all the protein they can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.55,0:48:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 答应他的要求吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Give him what he wants!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.64,0:48:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,荒地无法维持这种供应量 试算一下就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Wasteland won't sustain it. Run the numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.14,0:48:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 不死王 我的兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, my Immortan. My brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.32,0:48:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点决定 我要撑不住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make up your mind. Can't hold this much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.24,0:48:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,让瑞塔斯解决 老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let Rictus do it, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.24,0:48:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来严刑逼问那组密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll squeeze the code out of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.49,0:48:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 交给你 交给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, take it. Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.00,0:48:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个智障\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.50,0:48:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我忘记密码了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've forgotten the numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.88,0:48:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等等 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.42,0:48:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.76,0:48:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,对齁 还在我脑海中 想起来了 想起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep, it's in there, got it, got it, got it, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.47,0:48:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,肉体的快感差点害我失忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pleasure flushed them clean out of my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.10,0:49:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次别再这么做 兄弟 我脑神经很衰弱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't ever do that again, comrades. I'm a man with a fragile brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.94,0:49:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.40,0:49:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位…是我女儿 小狄\N{\fnArial\fs30}That… is my daughter, Little D.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.49,0:49:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,小狄门特斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little Dementus.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.29,0:49:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,她看起来跟你一点也不像\N{\fnArial\fs30}She looks nothing like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.79,0:49:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个嘛 她继承了她完美的母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, well, she has her mother's perfections,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.58,0:49:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全避开了我的缺陷\N{\fnArial\fs30}and none of my deficiencies.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.91,0:49:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,她妈妈在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.83,0:49:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,伟大的女人 强悍 聪慧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magnificent woman. Fierce, intelligent.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.34,0:49:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,却在保护小家伙免受掠夺者侵害时 被残忍杀害了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taken so cruelly protecting this little one from marauders.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.59,0:49:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,她看起来好苍白\N{\fnArial\fs30}She looks pale.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.72,0:49:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来才苍白 她很完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look pale. She's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.47,0:49:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不像你那两个基因突变的怪咖儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not like the genetic absurdities you have for sons.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.26,0:49:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很苍白是因为我为了 替他准备血肠而取了一点血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, she's pale because I take her blood, for blood pudding that I prepare for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.98,0:49:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.48,0:49:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是包治百病的器官维修工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm the Organic Mechanic. All things therapeutic.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.15,0:49:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你千万别搞错 她可是全寿人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, make no mistake, she is a full-life.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.82,0:49:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全未经人类或疾病的染指\N{\fnArial\fs30}Untouched by man or disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.99,0:50:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想留在堡垒吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like to stay here in the Citadel?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.33,0:50:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,若我让你留下 你就能长大成为强壮健康的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I let you stay and you grow to become a strong, healthy woman,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.63,0:50:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以加入我们的后宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}you could become one of our wives.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.05,0:50:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 她是我女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, she's my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.63,0:50:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会像是皇室联姻 能让强强联合\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will be a royal intermarriage. The bonding of dynasties.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.47,0:50:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保护了她一辈子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her whole life I have protected her,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.51,0:50:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不受风吹日晒和色狼的觊觎\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the sun, the wind, every lecherous gaze.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.47,0:50:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.39,0:50:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,两强能成为血缘姻亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be bonded by blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.18,0:50:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 她是非卖品 她是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! She's not for sale, she's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.85,0:50:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么说 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}What say you, child?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.81,0:50:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从她母亲惨死后她就没开过口\N{\fnArial\fs30}She hasn't spoken since her mother's tragic end.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.19,0:50:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,令人心酸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very poignant.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.41,0:50:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是你爸吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he your father?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.58,0:50:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.13,0:50:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他残杀了我母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}He slaughtered my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.60,0:51:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 那是事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}True, that is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.10,0:51:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我很确信那让她变得更坚强\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can tell you it made this child tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.02,0:51:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,强大到足以克服未来的任何打击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tough enough to survive all sorrows that may come her way.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.81,0:51:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是为了她好才那么做 我是为了她好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did that for her. I did that for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.65,0:51:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我每趟运货 会多给你三分之一的水量\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will increase your shipment of water. But only by a third.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.20,0:51:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,食物也增量四分之一 但只有马铃薯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will increase your food by a quarter. Potatoes only.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.41,0:51:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们每十天就会收到一批货\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll get your delivery once every ten days,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.17,0:51:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但前提是我的武装运输车要安全返回\N{\fnArial\fs30}but only if my War Rigs return safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.92,0:51:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,并满载精炼汽油\N{\fnArial\fs30}full of high-grade guzzolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.13,0:51:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,成交\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.88,0:51:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后 我要留下这女孩 她不是你女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And… I will take this girl, who is not your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.47,0:51:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,再加上 他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And also, him.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.48,0:51:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则 就开战吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otherwise, it's war.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.19,0:52:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你乖乖 我就会乖乖\N{\fnArial\fs30}You behave, I'll behave.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.57,0:52:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会保护炼油城不受任何侵害\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll protect Gastown from all treachery.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.69,0:52:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里会变得跟堡垒一样坚不可摧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will be as impenetrable as this Citadel.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.90,0:52:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,在混乱的世道中诞生出稳定局面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stability born from a world of chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.03,0:52:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 我 我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You. Me. We.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.29,0:52:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,从此以后 请尊称我为「伟大的狄门特斯」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henceforth, I will be addressed as "The Great Dementus."
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.04,0:52:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,重机王国的敬爱领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beloved ruler of Bikerdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.17,0:52:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,炼油城的守护领主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord Guardian of Gastown.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.97,0:53:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,得快闪了 我可不希望炼油城真的炸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta go, gotta go. Don't want Gastown to go boom.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.55,0:53:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,多棒的一天 多棒的交易 多棒的一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a day. What a deal. What a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.14,0:53:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得漂亮 老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beautifully played, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.35,0:53:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,狄门特斯最高\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peak Dementus!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.26,0:53:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 你很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right. You'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.02,0:53:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.56,0:53:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在快让美丽的小宝宝出来见世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, shove that little beauty out into the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.82,0:54:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 要出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Here it comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.82,0:54:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能看到头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see its head.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.58,0:54:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好女孩 好女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good girl. Good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.83,0:54:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 你做得非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. You're very clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.50,0:54:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,再用力最后一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}One last shove.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.00,0:54:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来一次 再来一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more, one more.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.38,0:54:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.80,0:54:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是男孩吗 是男孩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it a boy? Is it a boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.60,0:54:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,也算是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}More or less.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.77,0:54:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.40,0:54:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会帮你生下全寿人 我知道我能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will give you a full-life! I know that I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.36,0:54:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经三振出局了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three strikes, you're out.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.11,0:54:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞塔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rictus.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.41,0:54:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 让我留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, let me stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.08,0:54:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't fret, love.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.83,0:54:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会成为很棒的乳娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll make an excellent milker.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.76,0:56:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.68,0:57:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞塔斯 你弄丢什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rictus. You lose something?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.85,0:57:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是看看 随便看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just looking. Just looking around.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.36,0:57:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,在找什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.52,0:57:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.15,0:57:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,别骗我 你鬼鬼祟祟的 到底想干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Don't lie to me. You're up to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.57,0:57:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is it? - Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.78,0:57:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你在这里干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what're you doing here then?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.41,0:57:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为看到有人在跑 好像要逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I saw someone running. Running away.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.12,0:57:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那只是我的幻想 惹人心烦的梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it was just a dream. An annoying dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.13,0:58:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brake!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.80,0:58:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,司索工 绳索松脱了 去挂好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dogman. The loose cable! Secure it!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.06,0:58:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,把铲斗救回来 我们需要铲斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save the bucket! We need that bucket!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.70,0:58:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go down.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.37,0:59:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 换个身材小点的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Someone small.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.50,0:59:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.29,0:59:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.50,0:59:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Him.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.23,1:00:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,胆子还挺大的 小鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got a lot of ticker, boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.90,1:00:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,司闸员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brake Man.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.29,1:00:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在晋升为司索工了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the new dogman.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.63,1:00:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,3.偷渡者
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.73,1:00:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,列队 列队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Line up. Line up.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.48,1:00:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,快快快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Juva-jub-jub.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.15,1:01:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到神圣的造车坊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the house of holy motors.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.53,1:01:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要从这个废料场中 利用现有的零件\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna make us something mighty from this boneyard,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.74,1:01:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,打造出强大的新战车\N{\fnArial\fs30}from all these body parts.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.08,1:01:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,两台八缸V型引擎 一个牵引车头的底盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two hefty V8 engines, a chassis for a Prime Mover,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.12,1:01:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,2857个寻来的零件\N{\fnArial\fs30}2, 857 found objects.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.83,1:01:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会将它们全部组合\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we are going to put this all together.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.09,1:01:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,并打造出美丽的新战车\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are going to build something beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.55,1:01:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这样做是为了哪位\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're doing this for who?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.01,1:01:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不死老乔 - 哪位\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Immortan Joe. - Who?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.47,1:01:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会带领我们从末世灰烬中奋起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who will raise us from the ashes of this world.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.80,1:01:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备好要成为黑手了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you ready to be Black Thumbs?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.97,1:01:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不死王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Immorta!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.22,1:01:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.06,1:01:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不死王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Immorta!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.35,1:01:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about you?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.19,1:01:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼喊他的尊号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak his name.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.61,1:01:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会说话 他是哑巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}He don't speak. He's mute.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.07,1:01:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在哪里看过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where have I seen you before?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.44,1:01:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是司索工 非常能干\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a dogman. Very useful.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.99,1:01:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,也太瘦小\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scrawny.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.66,1:01:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还有很多事要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oi! We've got work to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.58,1:01:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要给自己打造一辆武装运输车\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to build ourselves a War Rig.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.25,1:01:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,荒地中最棒的运输神器\N{\fnArial\fs30}The finest piece of grunt in the Wasteland.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.25,1:01:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,更大 更强 更快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bigger, stronger, faster!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.92,1:01:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不死王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Immorta!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.50,1:02:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不死王 不死王 不死王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Immorta! Immorta! Immorta!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.82,1:02:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会在车尾打造防御武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are going to build a contraption that will defend the rear.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.49,1:02:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会称之为「流星锤」\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will call it "The Bommyknocker."
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.24,1:02:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是杰克禁卫官吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that the Praetorian Jack?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.41,1:02:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看起来很幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}He looks lucky.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.38,1:02:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是在愤怒道上 载运过最多趟的驾驶\N{\fnArial\fs30}He done the most runs on the Fury Road.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.09,1:02:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且每次都成功运回货品\N{\fnArial\fs30}And brung back the booty every time.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.43,1:02:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 杰克禁卫官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Prae Jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.47,1:03:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.73,1:03:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛要不好意思 只不过是小便\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why so shy? It's just piss.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.86,1:03:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那对疯子兄弟说得没错 它真的很美\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were right, the crazy brothers. She is a mighty thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.12,1:03:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,更大 更快 更强 能跑更远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bigger, faster, stronger, further.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.81,1:04:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,它来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here it comes.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.01,1:05:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来像是死神帮\N{\fnArial\fs30}They look like Mortifiers.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.05,1:05:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,死神帮 他们效忠于狄门特斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mortifiers. They ride with Dementus.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.18,1:05:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不是了 他们已分家自立\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not anymore. They've gone rogue.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.31,1:05:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌袭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Contact.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.48,1:05:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,前方有敌袭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Contact front!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.35,1:05:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们 去迎战\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.41,1:05:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,右边有敌袭 左边有敌袭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Contact right. Contact left.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.83,1:06:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,十字弓 战争男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crossbows, War Boys.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.46,1:06:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,备战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Load up.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.38,1:06:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你们身后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behind you!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.33,1:06:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.59,1:06:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.13,1:06:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,侧翼防御
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.92,1:06:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 攻击 - 再来一个
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.09,1:06:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,更多
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.64,1:06:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,活剥他
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.68,1:06:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,绕过他们
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.46,1:06:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,见证我们的壮烈成仁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Witness!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.36,1:07:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,二号引擎故障\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's engine two.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.20,1:07:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,车顶无人防御 增援\N{\fnArial\fs30}All down on top. Replenish!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.00,1:08:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要一个短软管和夹钳\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need a short hose and clamps!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.17,1:08:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,短软管 夹钳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Short hose. Clamps.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.88,1:08:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,短软管 夹钳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Short hose. Clamps.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.29,1:09:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.72,1:09:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑手 黑手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Black Thumb? Black Thumb.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.89,1:09:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,去前面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up front.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.60,1:09:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以启动流星锤了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I do the Bommyknocker?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.19,1:09:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 流星锤\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - The Bommyknocker.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.19,1:09:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.66,1:10:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意左边 他们在攻击侧翼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eyes left. They're flanking us.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.54,1:10:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意右边 注意右边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eyes right. Eyes right.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.58,1:10:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,越来越多追兵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're swarming.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.00,1:10:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Black Thumb.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.60,1:10:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑手 你在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Black Thumb! Are you there?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.73,1:10:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就抓紧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now hang tight.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.84,1:10:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,老杰 老杰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prae Jack! Prae Jack!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.23,1:11:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,尿童 尿童 水箱故障了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pissboy. Pissboy! We got a busted radiator.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.91,1:11:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 老杰 现在就去修\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy P-Jack. On my way.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.16,1:11:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,快喝吧 运输车 喝我的尿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drink, my rig. Drink this piss.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.46,1:11:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.47,1:11:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,老杰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prae Jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.29,1:12:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,见证吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Witness!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.00,1:12:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.48,1:14:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,流星锤 快用流星锤\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Bommyknocker! Do the Bommyknocker!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.52,1:14:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.61,1:14:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.39,1:16:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠边停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull over.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.85,1:16:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就靠边停 然后下车\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to pull over and get out.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.02,1:16:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.14,1:17:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为你要去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you think you were going?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.73,1:17:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你想逃离堡垒\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're running away from the Citadel,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.48,1:17:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 兵工农场比堡垒更恐怖\N{\fnArial\fs30}believe me, the Bullet Farm is a whole lot worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.11,1:17:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩下的选择只有炼油城 那里由狄门特斯当家做主\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only other place is Gastown. It's in the hands of Dementus.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.61,1:17:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个蠢蛋根本无法管控手下\N{\fnArial\fs30}A mug who can't even keep his gangs together.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.74,1:17:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有这些地方 没有别处可去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's it. There is nowhere else.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.79,1:17:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是荒地\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the Wasteland.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.79,1:17:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你以为可以去哪 那里都不存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wherever you thought you were going does not exist.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.59,1:17:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天很惨烈\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a hard day.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.34,1:18:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我失去了我的车队和组员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost my convoy. I lost my crew.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.97,1:18:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得从头开始打造一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna have to start again.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.01,1:18:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开车离去时心想 我们可以一起重来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm driving off thinking I ought to start with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.35,1:18:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的视力很好 能随机应变又能保持冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got good vision. You read the play and you keep your head.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.15,1:18:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你或许还很青涩 但你既强悍又果敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may be raw, but you have about you a purposeful savagery.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.11,1:18:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要假以时日\N{\fnArial\fs30}You give me time,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.12,1:18:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能教会你 公路战争所需要知道的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll teach you everything you need to know about Road War.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.58,1:18:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,若我们经历一切后你能存活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you survive everything we take on together,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.87,1:18:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就会有本事 前往任何你想去的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll have all the skills you need to get wherever you wanna go.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.71,1:18:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会多问前因后果\N{\fnArial\fs30}No questions asked.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.10,1:18:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,留着吧 你会需要它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it. You'll need it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.12,1:19:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,4.回家
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.39,1:19:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿星辰与你同在\N{\fnArial\fs30}The stars be with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.02,1:19:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿星辰与你同在\N{\fnArial\fs30}The stars be with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.73,1:19:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我 小狄\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and me, Little D.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.65,1:20:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,兵工农场 荒地第三要塞
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.38,1:20:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,二 四 六 八…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two… four… six… eight…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.01,1:20:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 运输槽空了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Done. Tank's empty.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.60,1:20:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有物资清点完成 包括每一滴母乳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything accounted, down to the last drop of Mother's Milk.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.73,1:20:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很好 - 不 才不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good. - No, it's not good.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.44,1:21:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个蠢蛋狄门特斯 他快把炼油城整个毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That piece of anus-pus, Dementus, is running Gastown into the ground.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.98,1:21:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,还把一切怪罪到别人身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}and blaming everyone but himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.61,1:21:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你告诉不死老乔 我们需要举行会议\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell Immortan Joe we need a meeting.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.53,1:21:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个战争会议\N{\fnArial\fs30}A war meeting.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.03,1:21:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我们很快就会大难临头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otherwise we're gonna get our tits caught in the wringer.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.37,1:21:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你要的轰鸣枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's the boomstick you asked for.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.80,1:21:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷霆长矛和子弹都运上车了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thundersticks. Bullets all loaded.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.11,1:21:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}For you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.53,1:21:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了之后的旅程\N{\fnArial\fs30}For your travels.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.33,1:21:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里待够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're done here.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.87,1:21:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以自由离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're free to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.67,1:22:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,食物 饮水 和交通工具 不管你需要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Food, water, wheels, whatever you need.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.46,1:22:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都会帮你准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll help you put it together.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.59,1:22:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我几天时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a couple of days.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.20,1:23:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们护送你们进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll lead you in.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.66,1:24:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,开工 动作快 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Hurry up! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.46,1:24:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,退下 滚远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back! Get out then!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.98,1:24:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,退下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.06,1:24:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,退下 往后退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back! Stand back.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.61,1:24:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,炼油城的乡亲们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Citizens of Gastown.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.53,1:24:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你们一样 都想要吃喝不尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want what you want. A full belly…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.49,1:24:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,弹药充足 还要有满缸的汽油\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a fistful of bullets for a tank of gas.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.12,1:24:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得纠正错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to put things right.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.12,1:24:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天 我们要付诸行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}And today, we're gonna do something about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.80,1:24:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是负责人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you in charge here?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.72,1:25:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以跟我谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can speak to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.64,1:25:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.27,1:25:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有消息要传递给不死老乔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I've got a message for Immortan Joe.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.06,1:25:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的情况越来越糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in a black spiral here.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.48,1:25:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们无法维持供应量\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't keep up supply.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.77,1:25:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都说自己被坑了 被偷斤减两了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone is saying they're being swindled and short-changed.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.28,1:25:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都说是我的错 其实这是所有人的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone is saying it's my fault. It's everyone's fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.07,1:25:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要跟所有军阀会谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want a meeting of the warlords.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.53,1:25:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 他 食人兽 和白痴兵工农场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, him, the People Eater, that idiot Bullet Farmer.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.71,1:25:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,正午时分在堡垒 时间三天后\N{\fnArial\fs30}High noon at the Citadel. Three days from now.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.54,1:25:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.92,1:25:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ah, you better go.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.47,1:25:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有拿到满载的汽油我们不走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not leaving without our tankers full of gas.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.97,1:25:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go now.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.86,1:25:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,若想安全离开 就跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna get out of here, follow me.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.59,1:27:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,正午时分在堡垒 时间三天后\N{\fnArial\fs30}High noon, the Citadel, three days from now.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.30,1:27:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,别迟到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be punctual.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.30,1:27:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给了他整车的水 两千份母乳\N{\fnArial\fs30}You give him a full tank of water, and 2, 000 tits of Mother's Milk.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.93,1:27:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,却空手而归\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then you return empty-handed.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.98,1:27:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,一滴汽油也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a drop of guzzolene.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.85,1:27:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他坑了我们 我们被耍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He filched us. We're being filched.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.56,1:27:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们杀了他 现在就杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's kill him. Right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.27,1:27:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,很早以前就该下手的 老爸 早就应该干掉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoulda done it long ago, Dad. Shoulda crushed him, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.86,1:28:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲 请把武装运输车给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father, give me the War Rig.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.24,1:28:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,载满我们所有的火力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Load it up with all of the firepower you've got,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.40,1:28:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会将他从地球表面炸飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I will blow him from the face of the earth.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.70,1:28:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要如何在他 炸毁炼油城之前下手\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we do that before he blows up Gastown?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.91,1:28:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以重建那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll build it again.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.03,1:28:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那要花上好几世代 蠢材\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'd take generations, you moron.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.95,1:28:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以重建 就是因为你畏首畏尾他才能白嫖我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will build it again. Your way of thinking is how he rooks us.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.21,1:28:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他用他的疯狂吓退了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got you scared of his crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.96,1:28:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's what we do!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.13,1:28:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要节约每一滴石油\N{\fnArial\fs30}We conserve every drop of guzzolene,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.21,1:28:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,停驶所有车辆 关闭所有发动机\N{\fnArial\fs30}turn off all vehicles, all generators.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.30,1:28:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,关闭每个水泵 包括四大含水层虹吸抽水器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn off every water pump including the Big Four Aquifer Siphons.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.55,1:28:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.43,1:28:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,天一亮 就开着 空的运输车前往兵工农场\N{\fnArial\fs30}At first light, leave for Bullet Farm with your tankers empty.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.97,1:28:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后尽可能多载点弹药回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, return with every munition you can load.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.06,1:28:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要每种子弹和枪械 每个口径和尺寸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want every bullet and firearm, every caliber and size.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.23,1:28:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的整个步兵队伍都要准备好作战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your entire infantry ready to pick up.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.94,1:28:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.40,1:28:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来瞭望台 我们现在就向他们发出讯号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come to the watchtower. We'll signal them now.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.57,1:28:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地 我们终于要攻击炼油城了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell and Hall-elujah! We're gonna take Gastown.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.78,1:28:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,攻击他 趁他最没防备时攻击他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit him! Hit him when he least suspects it.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.83,1:28:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要如何阻止他引爆炼油城\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we stop him blowing up Gastown?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.57,1:29:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,位于你秘密地图终点处的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place at the end of your map of secrets.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.61,1:29:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.25,1:29:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的父母原本是军人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mother and father were soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.13,1:29:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,就连世界末日时 他们仍渴望为正义而战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even as the world fell, they yearned to be warriors for a virtuous cause.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.10,1:29:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们没能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}For them, it never happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.69,1:30:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想帮你找到那地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna help you find this place.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.53,1:30:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管那在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wherever it may be.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.64,1:30:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.80,1:31:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.98,1:31:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要你的重机\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want your bikes.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.32,1:31:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它们绑在追击冲锋车的后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Load them on the back of the V8 Pursuit and tie them down.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.82,1:31:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,等绑好后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon as that's done,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.07,1:31:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,再装上食物 汽油 和水\N{\fnArial\fs30}load it with food, fuel and water.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.24,1:31:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,能载多少载多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}As much as you can carry.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.54,1:31:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是要干嘛 去当侦察先锋吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this? A scouting party?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.37,1:31:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possibly.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.96,1:31:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about us?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.09,1:31:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们就坐在油罐车上\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're both gonna ride on the tanker.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.34,1:31:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about me?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.63,1:31:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被升职了 担任后方防守\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're promoted. Rear defense.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.59,1:31:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在武装运输车上 - 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- On the War Rig? - Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.93,1:31:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.81,1:32:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,有问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there a problem?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.48,1:32:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来开冲锋车\N{\fnArial\fs30}You drive the V8.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.48,1:32:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要开武装运输车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I drive the War Rig.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.69,1:32:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天不行 今天你开冲锋车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not today. Today you drive Pursuit.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.27,1:32:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那我要干嘛 - 你跟着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What am I gonna do? - You're with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.07,1:32:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 坐前面吗 - 坐前面\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Up front? - Up front.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.61,1:32:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我们载好武器弹药后 你就把运输车开回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as we load up the weapons and munitions, you can drive the rig back.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.12,1:32:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,直接回家吗 回堡垒\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the way home? To the Citadel?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.54,1:32:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.45,1:32:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,上吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.18,1:32:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,想见识一下这辆车的威力吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanna see what this can do?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.51,1:32:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动第二引擎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit the second engine.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.01,1:33:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,全死了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All dead?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.47,1:34:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.64,1:34:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,狙击手伏击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sniper ambush!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.77,1:34:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有援军 在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got backup. Outside.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.27,1:34:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,在两截油罐车间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Between the tanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.19,1:34:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看不到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't see him.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.83,1:34:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behind you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.18,1:36:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,别失手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not miss.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.98,1:37:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在哪 能看到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they? Can you see them?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.07,1:37:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,在墙脊上 大门左边\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the ridge, to the left of the gate.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.63,1:38:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me that.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.98,1:38:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 帮我填充 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, load me up. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.27,1:38:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.02,1:39:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.03,1:40:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了吗 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? We're good.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.52,1:41:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们朝东开三日\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll head east for three days.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.24,1:41:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦越过悬崖和盐滩平原后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once we clear the escarpment and the great salt plains,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.53,1:41:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,就改骑重机横越沙丘 一路直下\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll take the bikes over the dunes all the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.24,1:41:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,一路直下\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.68,1:41:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪手 我们用怪手\N{\fnArial\fs30}The digger. Let's use the digger.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.89,1:41:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No time.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.98,1:41:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,下车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.88,1:44:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲啊 冲啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fang it! Fang it!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:24.86,1:45:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.23,1:46:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one's still alive!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.98,1:46:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:08.70,1:46:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up here.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.70,1:46:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 过来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, get up here.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:14.45,1:46:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有看到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.79,1:46:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到他们如何为彼此奋战 像一对小战友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see how they fought for each other, this little army of two?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.63,1:46:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们如此满怀希望地是想奔向哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where were they going, so full of hope?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.46,1:46:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本没有希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no hope!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:28.18,1:46:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们没有 你们没有 我当然更没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not for them, not for you! Certainly not for me!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.10,1:46:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我攻下兵工农场那天 这两人来搅局\N{\fnArial\fs30}The day I acquire Bullet Farm, these two destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.81,1:46:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我主宰炼油城 我攻下兵工农场 借此 我可以逼降堡垒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had Gastown, I had Bullet Farm. With that, I coulda crippled the Citadel.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:41.65,1:46:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杰克 - 并统治荒地\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jack. - Ruled the Wasteland!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.73,1:46:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我本可以让荒地 - 我的杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The Wasteland woulda been… - My Jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.40,1:46:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 变成更好的地方 - 芙莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …a far better place for all of us. - Fury.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.07,1:46:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杰克 - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jack. - No!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.07,1:46:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.87,1:46:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个 真的很伤我的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two. You two break my heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.08,1:47:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们让我心碎 那不公平\N{\fnArial\fs30}You break my heart. And that's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:02.21,1:47:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们让我成为黑暗的狄门特斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You make me the Dark Dementus.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:06.63,1:47:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,而黑暗的狄门特斯 绝不能容许自己心软\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Dark Dementus cannot afford to be soft!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.59,1:47:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我身为领袖必须付出的代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the price I pay to be your leader!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:13.47,1:47:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们在荒地求生存 都必须付出的代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the price we all pay to survive in the Wasteland.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.56,1:47:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能心软\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cannot be soft!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:21.35,1:47:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有仇一定要报\N{\fnArial\fs30}There must be retribution.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:25.19,1:47:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,主持公道和有仇必报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Justice and retribution.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:43.96,1:47:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:46.50,1:47:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要让她先看着 把她吊起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want her to watch a while. String her up.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:50.30,1:47:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟着去吧 跟着去吧 跟着去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going. You're going. You're going.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:54.34,1:47:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,走啰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:03.06,1:48:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟 用受伤的那只手\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, mate, other arm.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.11,1:48:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 你越来越生疏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? You lost your touch?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:13.91,1:48:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:38.51,1:48:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊 小猪仔 起来 起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, piggy! Get up. Get up!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.87,1:48:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去吧 快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:01.26,1:50:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,弄臣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smeg!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:09.98,1:50:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了 够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough! Enough!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:13.23,1:50:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我腻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm bored.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:16.11,1:50:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,休闲时间结束 我们回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's end our cares and go home!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:38.09,1:52:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:40.26,1:52:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续睡吧 我会让你舒服点的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go back to sleep. I'll make it nice for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.93,1:52:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:48.06,1:52:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里至少可以安祥地死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll find peace here.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:58.94,1:53:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是芙莉欧莎禁卫官\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the Praetorian Furiosa.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:02.78,1:53:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是芙莉欧莎禁卫官\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the Praetorian Furiosa!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:05.66,1:53:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发生什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:07.45,1:53:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:17.58,1:53:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,有看到他的踪迹吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any sign of him?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:19.34,1:53:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:20.92,1:53:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在炼油城有不寻常的动静\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there's something going on at Gastown.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:23.63,1:53:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他要炸毁炼油城了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he's blowing up Gastown.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:25.34,1:53:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rubbish.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:26.80,1:53:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己看\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Take a look.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:29.14,1:53:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他先是缺席会议 现在又这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}He fails to turn up to a meeting and now this.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:35.73,1:53:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fake.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:37.56,1:53:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样做完全没有任何好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no possible advantage.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:39.48,1:53:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不该迟疑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shouldn't have waited.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:41.61,1:53:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为何要按兵不动 现在就出发前往炼油城\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why're we waiting now? Let's go to Gastown now.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:44.61,1:53:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不在炼油城\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not at Gastown.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:48.82,1:53:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克禁卫官在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Praetorian Jack?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:51.95,1:53:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的武装运输车呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's our War Rig?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:53.25,1:53:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他拿下了兵工农场\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's taken the Bullet Farm.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:54.62,1:53:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lying.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:55.62,1:53:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他拿下了兵工农场 接下来就要打来这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's taken the Bullet Farm, and he's coming here next.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:58.42,1:53:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是如何知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:59.88,1:54:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们带着攻墙的家伙来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're coming with grappling hooks and ladders.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:02.30,1:54:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想要拿下堡垒\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants to take the Citadel.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:04.01,1:54:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就去兵工农场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we go to the Bullet Farm.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:05.55,1:54:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就跟他正面对决\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meet him head-on right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:07.18,1:54:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,炼油城正在燃烧 他人在炼油城\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Gastown that's burning. He's at Gastown.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:09.72,1:54:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想要把你们骗去炼油城\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants to draw you to Gastown.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:11.97,1:54:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,让堡垒人去楼空 无人防守\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants you to leave the Citadel exposed.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:14.27,1:54:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we stay here.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:16.10,1:54:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有三个选择：懦夫的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have three choices. The coward's choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:19.27,1:54:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,留在这里 并让狄门特斯扰乱我们的心智\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here and let Dementus mess with our minds.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:22.23,1:54:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,傻瓜的选择 在前往兵工农场的路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fool's choice, go out and meet an invisible enemy.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:25.03,1:54:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,与一支隐形军队作战\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the road to the Bullet Farm.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:26.86,1:54:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,又或是战士的选择 前往炼油城歼灭他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or the warrior's choice, go to Gastown and crush him.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:30.57,1:54:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,选择权在我 误导他去以为我们要去炼油城\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is my choice. We make him think we're going to Gastown.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:37.54,1:54:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你抓到他 他的命是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you find him, he's mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:04.65,1:55:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了 有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:08.70,1:55:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们确定朝炼油城出发了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're Gastown bound for sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:16.87,1:55:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好骗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So gullible.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:18.83,1:55:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我深深地鄙视他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hold them profoundly in contempt.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:31.64,1:55:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 时候到了 战争时刻到来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemans, it's time. Time to do war.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:35.06,1:55:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候夺回本就属于我们的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to take back what's rightfully ours.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:37.81,1:55:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,朝堡垒前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the Citadel.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:39.35,1:55:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,派对开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's party!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:36.12,1:56:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这世上永远都会有战争开打\N{\fnArial\fs30}There always was, is, and will be war.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:43.12,1:56:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏美人曾与埃兰人作战\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Sumerian fought the Elamite.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:46.04,1:56:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,撒克逊人也曾与维京人作战\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Saxon fought the Viking.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:49.84,1:56:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,历史总在不断地复制上演\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so the histories grew.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:52.76,1:56:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾有玫瑰战争 橘子战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were the Wars of the Roses, The Oranges.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:57.01,1:56:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,鸦片战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Opium Wars.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:00.39,1:57:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,一日战争 六日战争 千日战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}The One-Day, Six-Day, Thousand-Day Wars.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:07.81,1:57:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,南北对抗 东西相争\N{\fnArial\fs30}North against South. East against West.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:15.66,1:57:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一 第二 第三次 无数次关于宗教和正义的战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first, second, third countless wars of religion and righteous belief.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:26.83,1:57:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,石油战争 水源战争 三国核战\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Oil Wars. Water Wars. The Tri-Nation Nuclear War.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:33.51,1:57:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,新兴城镇之战\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Battle of the Boomtowns.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:37.26,1:57:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,而现在 亲爱的 四十天荒地战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, my dears…The Forty-Day Wasteland War.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:01.45,1:58:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,以眼还眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eyes for eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:04.66,1:58:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,以牙还牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teeth for teeth.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:09.46,1:58:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,悲伤让怒火燎原\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rage fueled by grief.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:36.36,1:58:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要交通工具\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:38.78,1:58:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里什么都没有 连重机都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing here, not even a bike.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:40.45,1:58:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把我降下去 - 你要怎么做 用走的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winch me down. - What're you gonna do? Walk?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:47.33,1:58:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有一台车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got a vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:58.63,1:59:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等不及要给你看了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't wait for you to see it.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:07.39,1:59:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是不是很美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't she wonderful?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:22.63,2:00:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 你们瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:25.68,2:00:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个尺寸应该符合\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think this one might fit.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:29.10,2:00:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,装装看 装装看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try it on! Try it on!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:34.65,2:00:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们每浪费一秒 那个杂种就会逃得更远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every moment wasted, that mongrel gets farther and farther away.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:39.69,2:00:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,要出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming up!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:42.28,2:00:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要把旧车上的油抽走\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I want her fuel too.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:43.86,2:00:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,把油和水抽干 所有武器拆走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want all of her fuel, and her water and her weapon.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:48.66,2:00:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个傻蛋可以逃 但他躲不了多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fool can run, but he can't hide.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:54.75,2:00:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,尺寸肯定相符\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna fit.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:56.88,2:00:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 史阔塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Scrotus.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:58.42,2:01:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 史阔塔 - 干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Scrotus! - What?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:00.21,2:01:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要先好好吃一餐 来点狗肉串\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll need some proper tucker. Canine kebab.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:04.34,2:01:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们打包带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll take it with us.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:05.76,2:01:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的「我们」是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, "us?"
Dialogue: 0,2:01:06.97,2:01:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要跟你一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming with you.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:08.01,2:01:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你不行去 你只会拖累我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're not. You'll slow me down.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:09.85,2:01:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要确保那蠢蛋狄门特斯这次死透\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna make sure that dumb Dementus is dead.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:12.14,2:01:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不行 你留下来吃狗肉串\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're not! You stay here and eat some dog.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:26.78,2:01:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:28.24,2:01:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是暗黑天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is the darkest of angels.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:32.62,2:01:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,启示录中的第五骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fifth Rider of the Apocalypse.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:41.76,2:01:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,5.超越复仇
Dialogue: 0,2:02:25.97,2:02:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是些什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:27.34,2:02:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,能力超强且满怀怨恨的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone competent and excessively resentful.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:30.39,2:02:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who do you suppose they want?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:31.85,2:02:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,远离手下并落单的我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, without my crew.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:34.68,2:02:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这里埋伏 突袭他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll wait here. Ambush him.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:36.69,2:02:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go back.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:37.60,2:02:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 我们得分散开来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. We have to split up.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:40.06,2:02:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样 没时间拥抱告别了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, no time for long goodbyes.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:42.11,2:02:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起干了不少大事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've done some mighty things together.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:43.78,2:02:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,掰了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:22.96,2:04:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是狄门特斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not Dementus!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:27.71,2:04:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们交换了重机\N{\fnArial\fs30}We swapped bikes!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:07.33,2:07:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've found me.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:11.42,2:07:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freakish.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:13.42,2:07:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是个怪胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a freak.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:17.97,2:07:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以在半夜割喉让我速死 但你没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could have necked me in the night, but you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:21.09,2:07:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你肯定是另一种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you must be that other thing.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:24.81,2:07:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是那种人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you that thing?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:05.70,2:09:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have nothing.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:08.79,2:09:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么也不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am nothing.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:12.04,2:09:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,任凭你处置\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm yours.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:34.56,2:09:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember me?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:49.41,2:09:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这完美的造物\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fabulous thing.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:55.12,2:09:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从比地狱还深的无情坟墓中爬出\N{\fnArial\fs30}You crawled out of a pitiless grave, deeper than Hell.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:00.38,2:10:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一样东西能促使你向前\N{\fnArial\fs30}And only one thing's gonna do that for you.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:02.67,2:10:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是希望 而是恨\N{\fnArial\fs30}And not hope. Hate.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:06.80,2:10:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,满心仇恨也没关系 那是世上最强大的力量之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}No shame in hate. It's one of the great forces of nature.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:15.35,2:10:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是心存希望 只是本能\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wasn't hope, that was instinct.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:32.12,2:10:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,2:10:34.58,2:10:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天就是我的死期\N{\fnArial\fs30}…this is the day I die.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:37.08,2:10:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前总是好奇我会怎么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've always wondered how…
Dialogue: 0,2:10:42.71,2:10:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,十五年前有个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifteen years ago there was a woman.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:45.17,2:10:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,唉呦 原来还有隐情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, so there's more to this.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:47.18,2:10:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你记得她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember her?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:49.30,2:10:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,能给我点提示吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I get a clue?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:56.19,2:10:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好喔 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, okay. Um…
Dialogue: 0,2:10:58.65,2:11:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,红发 连阴毛都是红的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Redhead. Even her pu…
Dialogue: 0,2:11:03.82,2:11:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是你妈 你姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was she your mother? Sister?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:06.95,2:11:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有求饶吗 有尖叫吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did she beg, did she scream?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:08.91,2:11:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得的通常都是最少求饶的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ones who yell the least tend to stick in my mind.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:14.04,2:11:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管你对她万般折磨 她还是强大不屈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Despite everything you did to her, she was magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:17.08,2:11:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来你也在场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you were there.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:20.79,2:11:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的童年 我的母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}My childhood. My mother.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:24.63,2:11:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你还给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want them back.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:26.67,2:11:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当然会那么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course you do.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:27.72,2:11:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你还给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want them back!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:29.26,2:11:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前也有同样的痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's exactly how I felt.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:31.14,2:11:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己的家庭 我美丽的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My own family. My own magnificent beauties.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:34.10,2:11:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,同样被如此不公地剥夺了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taken so unjustly. Immutably.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:36.77,2:11:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你一样 我跟你同病相怜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm right there, I'm right there with you.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:41.23,2:11:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也一心渴望复仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I too craved nothing but revenge.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:43.94,2:11:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,满心都只想复仇血恨\N{\fnArial\fs30}A big bellyful of revenge.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:48.20,2:11:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想建议…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I may…
Dialogue: 0,2:11:50.91,2:11:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,若从背后开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the shooter goes around the back,
Dialogue: 0,2:11:52.57,2:11:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,受刑人就不会知道子弹何时击发\N{\fnArial\fs30}the shootee won't know the precise moment of the execution.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:57.83,2:12:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是小小的折磨 但毕竟有一点算一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Minor torture, but every little bit counts.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:00.46,2:12:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何 那把猎鼠枪 会快速将我脑浆变成粉色水雾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either way, that rat shot will turn my brain into a pink mist so fast,
Dialogue: 0,2:12:03.84,2:12:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我甚至不会听到枪声\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't even hear the sound of the gun.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:06.63,2:12:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会听到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll hear it.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:08.42,2:12:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我终其一生都会听到 - 你当然会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll hear it for the rest of my days. - Of course you will.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:11.05,2:12:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的手还会感受到后座力 - 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll feel the kickback in my hand. - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:15.60,2:12:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会记得你的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll remember your face.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:17.93,2:12:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,当子弹穿透你大脑的软组织时\N{\fnArial\fs30}As the slug worms its way into the soft matter of your brain,
Dialogue: 0,2:12:21.69,2:12:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,会带走那些被你称为逻辑的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}taking with it what you call your reason.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:24.77,2:12:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你的记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your memory,
Dialogue: 0,2:12:26.98,2:12:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸好关于我母亲的记忆 会从中缺席\N{\fnArial\fs30}from which my mother will fortunately be absent.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:29.86,2:12:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,太高明了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:31.11,2:12:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会死掉 而你还是会继续哀吊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be dead and you'll still be sorrowing.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:33.37,2:12:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那可爱又强大的好妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}your lovey-dovey and your mommy magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:36.49,2:12:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个蠢蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You idiot.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:37.74,2:12:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永远无法弥补他们所承受的苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can never balance the scales of their suffering.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:43.75,2:12:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还给我 - 我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Give them back. - I can't!
Dialogue: 0,2:12:48.05,2:12:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 你想要的是看我痛哭流涕\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you want, dear, are my cries of anguish.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:50.59,2:12:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,挖心掏肺的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anguish without end.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:52.30,2:12:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,若我能让你满意 我很愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I could give you that, I would.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:54.51,2:12:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我无惧于错失天堂路\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't fear the loss of bliss in Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:56.89,2:12:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不害怕地狱来索命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or retribution in Hell.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:59.22,2:13:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我对疼痛的耐受度 更是出奇的高\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I've got a fiendishly high pain threshold.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:01.81,2:13:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 再来一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again, do it again.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:09.19,2:13:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你不让我好死 那就慢慢地折磨我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you can't do me quick, you'll have to do me slow.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:14.66,2:13:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你永远不可能借此获得心灵的平静\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you are never going to get anything close to what you want.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:15.80,2:14:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,小狄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little D?
Dialogue: 0,2:14:23.68,2:14:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:26.40,2:14:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在等待像你这样的人 一个配得上我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been waiting for someone like you, someone worthy of me.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:32.86,2:14:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有荣誉感 更无视法理秩序\N{\fnArial\fs30}No honor, no rule of law to sort things out.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:36.91,2:14:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是荒地中的两个邪恶混帐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just two evil bastards out here in the Wasteland.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:41.58,2:14:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了我 只要下手得宜 你就能成为我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do this, you do this right, you become me.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:45.25,2:14:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我跟你一点也不像 - 你就是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I am nothing like you. - You are me.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:48.00,2:14:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个活死人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Already dead.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:49.84,2:14:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了感觉活着 我们寻求感官刺激\N{\fnArial\fs30}To feel alive, we seek sensation.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:51.92,2:14:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何刺激 只为了掩盖住躁郁的邪恶悲伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any sensation to wash away the cranky black sorrow.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:56.34,2:14:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们只能短暂遗忘 但悲伤很快就会返回\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it leaves us for a moment, but then it comes back,
Dialogue: 0,2:14:59.34,2:15:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只好一再重复\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we have to do it all again.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:00.85,2:15:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快我们就需要更多刺激\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we need more,
Dialogue: 0,2:15:02.10,2:15:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次都需要更多 直到再怎么也不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}and each time we need more until too much is never enough.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:05.06,2:15:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已是活死人 小狄\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are the already dead, Little D.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:12.61,2:15:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and me.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:23.74,2:15:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The question is…
Dialogue: 0,2:15:28.12,2:15:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有强悍到 足以精彩地干掉我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}…do you have it in you to make it epic?
Dialogue: 0,2:15:51.02,2:15:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,她先是让他永远无法说话 最后的时光里两人沉默以对\N{\fnArial\fs30}She took away his voice, and they spent the rest of the day in silence.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:58.28,2:16:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些人会希望 她不仅只是单纯地射杀他\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are those who prefer that she did more than shoot him.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:05.29,2:16:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们声称 她以更合适的方式了结了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}They claim that she ended him in ways more fitting.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:13.54,2:16:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们讲述着正义的变态 和诙谐的刑罚\N{\fnArial\fs30}They tell of righteous perversities and witty mutilations.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:21.51,2:16:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但以下才是芙莉欧莎 亲口对我诉说的真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this is the truth whispered to me by Furiosa herself.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:28.81,2:16:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,在堡垒深处 地处高地的水耕花园里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deep in the Citadel, high up in the hydroponic gardens,
Dialogue: 0,2:16:35.19,2:16:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有棵不同寻常的树\N{\fnArial\fs30}there is a tree unlike any other.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:42.53,2:16:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,由人体为土壤 更吸食其养分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Its soil is human. Its nutrients human.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:47.87,2:16:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,蛆虫蚕食他衰败的肉体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggots debriding his necrotic flesh.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:52.62,2:16:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一个从生命体中 孕育出的绿色生机\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was an echo growing out of a living being.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:03.93,2:17:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的第一颗果实 但这不属于你和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our first fruit, but it's not for you and me.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:09.02,2:17:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你我终有一日会从这世上消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each of us in our own way will vanish from this Earth.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:12.94,2:17:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后或许…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then perhaps…
Dialogue: 0,2:17:15.48,2:17:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,某些未经污染过的生命 能再度降临 为这世界增添色彩\N{\fnArial\fs30}…some uncorrupted life will rise to adorn it.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:58.46,2:28:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,翻译：张君怡
